# Observed libusb installation

What this library was verified against. It is a record of an installed package
rather than a vendored tree: libusb-1.0 comes from the system, and nothing here
is a copy of its source.

pkg-config --modversion libusb-1.0   1.0.29
pkg-config --libs libusb-1.0         -lusb-1.0
header                               /usr/include/libusb-1.0/libusb.h

The include path pkg-config reports (/usr/include/libusb-1.0) is passed via
include-directory in the provider manifest.
